  "description": "Genomics.Sequences is the sequence foundation for the Genomics .NET ecosystem. Provides first-class DNA, RNA, and protein sequences over a compact nucleotide representation, with transcription, translation, reverse complement, slicing, and search operations, plus sequence algorithms: GC content, Hamming and Levenshtein distances, packed k-mers with composition, and exact motif search.",
